## Why This Is Asked
Evaluates designing an OTCA telemetry path for a real-time chat app with multi-region tenants, focusing on privacy at ingestion, data residency, and practical streaming topology.

## Key Concepts
- OTCA tenancy and data residency
- Chat-event schema (message_sent, typing events, read_receipt)
- Privacy at ingestion: redaction and hashing
- Idempotent deduplication and per-tenant rate limits
- Streaming: edge gateway, regional Kafka, Parquet on S3 with tenant/date partitions

## Code Example
```javascript
function redactEvent(e){
  const copy = { ...e };
  copy.user_id_hash = hash(copy.user_id_hash);
  delete copy.personal_message;
  return copy;
}
```

