- How would you evolve the schema for new event types without breaking dashboards?

## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical privacy controls in a real OTCA path, focusing on consent-driven data handling and per-tenant residency.

## Key Concepts
- Ingest pipelines with edge gateways and Kafka
- Privacy controls: redact/drop audio data, store digest only
- Per-tenant residency and retention windows

## Code Example
```javascript
function redact(event) {
  if (!event.consent_opt_in) delete event.audio_payload;
  event.audio_digest = hash(event.audio_payload || '');
  delete event.audio_payload;
  return event;
}
```

